\newlabel{fig:PhaseDiagram}{{3}{112}{An illustration of the (supervised) statistical process. Phase III contains two parts: First is the evaluation $\nabla (h,c)$ according to the data $\mathcal {D}$, and second is the $\mathsf {Update}$ process to re-align $c$ to the actual target}{figure.caption.56}{}}
